  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb — follows standard endings in every tense, no exceptions.",
    "Often used with \"en\": *insistir en algo* (\"to insist on something\").",
    "*Marcos insiste en llamarlo \"una en un millón\".* (\"Marcos insists on calling it 'one in a million'.\")",
    "*Insistí varias veces, pero no cambió de opinión.* (\"I insisted several times, but he/she didn't change his/her mind.\")",
    "Related: *la insistencia* (insistence, noun), *insistente* (insistent, adjective), *persistir* (near-synonym, \"to persist\")."
  ],
